This code assumes that the Seeed Studio Grove Moisture Sensors are connected to the MCP3008 ADC as described in the question. The MCP3008 is connected to the Raspberry Pi's hardware SPI0 bus (CE0 on GPIO8, MISO on GPIO9, MOSI on GPIO10, SCLK on GPIO11). The CS line is controlled using libgpiod.

