This code initializes the Raspberry Pi's hardware, sets up an ADC read thread, and controls the vibration motors based on the noise level detected by the MAX9814 electret microphone amplifier. It logs events to 'vibration_log.txt' when the noise level exceeds the threshold. The program handles errors gracefully and cleans up resources on SIGINT/SIGTERM.

