This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up signal handlers for SIGINT and SIGTERM, and periodically reads pressure values from the MLX90833 sensor. It logs the readings to the console with a timestamp every 500 ms. The code also handles errors during I2C read/write operations and sensor absence. The resources are released on exit via the `gpioTerm()` function when the program receives a SIGINT or SIGTERM signal.

