This code initializes the pigpio library, creates an I2C handle for bus 1, opens a file named `temperature_log.dat`, and reads the temperature from the TMP117 sensor every 5 seconds. It stores the readings in a rolling circular buffer and persists the entire buffer to the file on every sample and on exit. The program handles errors and releases all resources on SIGINT/SIGTERM.

