This code reads the relative humidity from an HTU21D sensor every 60 seconds and POSTs the reading as JSON to the specified URL. It handles I2C communication errors and HTTP POST failures, and uses syslog for logging. The program also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals for graceful shutdown.

