This code initializes the pigpio library, sets up hardware PWM for the RGB LED pins, and samples the CPU load every 500ms. It then maps the CPU load to a color gradient and updates the LED color accordingly. The program also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals by turning off the LED and cleaning up resources before exiting.

