This program initializes the MMA8452Q accelerometer, checks its ID, initializes the sensor, logs data when the X-axis tilt exceeds 45 degrees, and handles I2C syscall failures. It also installs a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler to close the I2C file descriptor and the log file before exiting. The log file is kept open for the program's lifetime and flushed after each entry rather than reopening it on every write.

