        gpiod_line_set_value(lines_data.lines[YELLOW_GPIO].line, 1);
        gpiod_line_set_value(lines_data.lines[GREEN_GPIO].line, 1);
        gpiod_line_set_value(lines_data.lines[BLACK_GPIO].line, 1);
        sleep(3);

        printf("State transition: %d\n", i);
    }

    return 0;
}
```

This code initializes the GPIO lines, sets up signal handlers for SIGINT and SIGTERM, and cycles through the traffic light states indefinitely. It also prints each state transition to stdout. Make sure to compile the code with `gcc -o traffic_light traffic_light.c -lgpiod -lrt`.

